{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":7,"ref":"1-samuel 7:7","book":"1-samuel","lang":"yo","chapter":7,"translation":"Àwọn Filistini gbọ́ pé àwọn ọmọ Yisrael ti pápọ̀ sí Mitspa; nítorí náà, àwọn olóyè Filistini gbé sókè lọ sọ́dọ̀ Yisrael. Nígbà tí àwọn ọmọ Yisrael gbọ́ èyí, wọ́n bẹ̀rù ìjaya láti ẹnuwọ́ àwọn Filistini.","tokens":[{"surface":"וישמעו","gloss":"gbọ́"},{"surface":"פלשתים","gloss":"àwọn Filistini"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"pé"},{"surface":"התקבצו","gloss":"ti pápọ̀"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"àwọn ọmọ"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Yisrael"},{"surface":"המצפתה","gloss":"sí Mitspa"},{"surface":"ויעלו","gloss":"gbé sókè lọ"},{"surface":"סרני","gloss":"àwọn olóyè"},{"surface":"פלשתים","gloss":"Filistini"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"sọ́dọ̀"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Yisrael"},{"surface":"וישמעו","gloss":"gbọ́"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"àwọn ọmọ"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Yisrael"},{"surface":"ויראו","gloss":"bẹ̀rù"},{"surface":"מפני","gloss":"láti ẹnuwọ́"},{"surface":"פלשתים","gloss":"àwọn Filistini"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:49:15.986697407Z","model":"glm-5.3"}